       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Version 1.1.0.0 brings a handful of small improvements and minor bug fixes to keep the invasion running smoothly. Just a bit of polish here and there to make sure your mission against the alien forces stays as fun and stable as possible.",
